The collector lane, source freshness, and latest-state architecture are adapted
from VentusIQ's src/ingest/lane_runner.py, source_freshness.py, and latest_state.py,
with authorization from the project owner. Changes include JSON payloads,
transactional SQLite storage, alert-specific cadence, retries, health reporting,
and bounded snapshot history. No trading logic, credentials, or private datasets
are included.

